  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Food Security via the Rapid Provision of Multipurpose Cash Assistance and Health Services in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this intervention, IOM is providing one off multi-purpose cash assistance (MPCA) and health services with an aim to contribute to reduced food insecurity for crisis-affected populations in Al Hodeidah and Taiz governorates.</narrative>
